{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Monster Destroyer",
    "steam_appid": 3828490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster has appeared, are the hunters ready!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each turn of the battle, monsters will appear on the battlefield. As long as the monster is not dead, it will continue to move around the chessboard, and all you need to do is recruit heroes to kill the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/71d8f43d0ba845930fe155b49cb6774e.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic qualities: From weak to strong, they are divided into white, blue, purple, gold, and red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero synthesis: Every 4 identical white heroes can be randomly synthesized into a blue hero, every 4 identical blue heroes can be synthesized into a purple hero, and every 3 identical purple heroes can be synthesized into a gold hero. Red heroes can only be synthesized based on the specified heroes and quantity required for different heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money: There are two types of money in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold coins: used to recruit heroes, enhance white, blue, and purple hero attributes, and increase recruitment levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver coins: used to enhance the attributes of gold and red heroes, or to draw heroes in the bottom right corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/c12d2b1776bcdb05402a4f88ea5db868.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attribute Enhancement: There are 9 types of attributes and 2 ways to enhance attributes, either by directly increasing the value or by increasing it as a percentage. Of course, the attributes improved during battles are temporary attributes that only take effect in this battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/23814c81994b48b7a7440871aaa2ecb6.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character development:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 27 cultivable roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White quality: 5 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue quality: 5 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purple quality: 5 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold quality: 5 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red quality: 7 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role skills:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has four personality skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character attributes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has 6 attributes that can be improved and can be freely selected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role Upgrade:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level of character can receive 1 skill point and 5 attribute points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to add points before entering the battle when starting the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy: Get energy every time you attack, red quality characters need energy to use skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic: Slow recovery, red quality characters require magic when using skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/b67e99131aeb66a175ee7d118f8b9d32.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Divine Weapon Prop:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 22 divine weapon props.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine weapon props take effect in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The function of divine weapon props is to enhance character attributes, improve character combat power, and increase economic gains in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamond: Used to upgrade characters, obtain character upgrade props, and divine weapon materials. Obtain combat rewards or complete achievement tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/53ace141d495a3f57e87e491fdd92f14.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero Gem:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White Gem: Upgrade to White Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sapphire: Upgrade to Blue Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purple Gem: Upgrade to Purple Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jinbao Stone: Upgrade to the Golden Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruby: Upgrade to Red Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to obtain Hero Gems is to play the &quot;Hero Gems&quot; game in the main menu. Detailed gameplay can be viewed in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/67251d1f61dd487f19f83a16ac4a9da0.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Obtaining materials for upgrading divine weapons:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game &quot;Divine Weapon Fragments&quot; in the main menu, and check out the detailed gameplay in the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster has appeared, are the hunters ready!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each turn of the battle, monsters will appear on the battlefield. As long as the monster is not dead, it will continue to move around the chessboard, and all you need to do is recruit heroes to kill the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/71d8f43d0ba845930fe155b49cb6774e.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroic qualities: From weak to strong, they are divided into white, blue, purple, gold, and red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero synthesis: Every 4 identical white heroes can be randomly synthesized into a blue hero, every 4 identical blue heroes can be synthesized into a purple hero, and every 3 identical purple heroes can be synthesized into a gold hero. Red heroes can only be synthesized based on the specified heroes and quantity required for different heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money: There are two types of money in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold coins: used to recruit heroes, enhance white, blue, and purple hero attributes, and increase recruitment levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver coins: used to enhance the attributes of gold and red heroes, or to draw heroes in the bottom right corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/c12d2b1776bcdb05402a4f88ea5db868.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attribute Enhancement: There are 9 types of attributes and 2 ways to enhance attributes, either by directly increasing the value or by increasing it as a percentage. Of course, the attributes improved during battles are temporary attributes that only take effect in this battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/23814c81994b48b7a7440871aaa2ecb6.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character development:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 27 cultivable roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White quality: 5 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue quality: 5 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purple quality: 5 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold quality: 5 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red quality: 7 pieces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role skills:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has four personality skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character attributes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has 6 attributes that can be improved and can be freely selected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role Upgrade:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level of character can receive 1 skill point and 5 attribute points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to add points before entering the battle when starting the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy: Get energy every time you attack, red quality characters need energy to use skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic: Slow recovery, red quality characters require magic when using skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/b67e99131aeb66a175ee7d118f8b9d32.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Divine Weapon Prop:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 22 divine weapon props.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine weapon props take effect in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The function of divine weapon props is to enhance character attributes, improve character combat power, and increase economic gains in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamond: Used to upgrade characters, obtain character upgrade props, and divine weapon materials. Obtain combat rewards or complete achievement tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/53ace141d495a3f57e87e491fdd92f14.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero Gem:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White Gem: Upgrade to White Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sapphire: Upgrade to Blue Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purple Gem: Upgrade to Purple Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jinbao Stone: Upgrade to the Golden Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruby: Upgrade to Red Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to obtain Hero Gems is to play the &quot;Hero Gems&quot; game in the main menu. Detailed gameplay can be viewed in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828490/extras/67251d1f61dd487f19f83a16ac4a9da0.avif?t=1753249961\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Obtaining materials for upgrading divine weapons:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game &quot;Divine Weapon Fragments&quot; in the main menu, and check out the detailed gameplay in the game.</p>",
